<title>USA: HA-LO acquires telemarketing firm.</title>
<headline>HA-LO acquires telemarketing firm.</headline>
<dateline>NILES, Ill. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>HA-LO Industries Inc said Friday it has acquired  Entertel Inc, a Kansas City telemarketing firm with 1996 revenues of $5.5 million.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Entertel has call centers in Kansas City, Missouri, Topeka, Kansas and Scottsdale, Arizona.</p>
<p>HA-LO distributes specialty advertising products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
